WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
RSV in older adults: could one shot prevent it?

2
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.500
AReSVi-006 vaccinated 24,966 participants adults aged 60 and older.

3
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:15.500
Vaccine efficacy against RSV lower respiratory tract disease: 82.6%.

4
00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:21.500
40 cases with placebo. 7 with the vaccine.

5
00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:27.500
Against severe disease: 94.1%.

6
00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:33.500
The trade-off: a sore arm in 60.9%, mostly mild and brief.

7
00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:39.500
The vaccine was 82.6% effective. N Engl J Med, 2023. Scroll for the full breakdown.
